                [
                    104.0,
                    688.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "d. The parties shall meet within the five (5) days immediately following receipt of notification of the Union's desire to arbitrate and select an arbitrator. Selection of an arbitrator shall be as prescribed in Article 51, Grievance and Arbitration.",
            "block_bbox": [
                104,
                689,
                1119,
                764
            ],
            "block_id": 7,
            "block_order": 8,
            "group_id": 7,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    104.0,
                    689.0
                ],
                [
                    1119.0,
                    689.0
                ],
                [
                    1119.0,
                    764.0
                ],
                [
                    104.0,
                    764.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "e. The parties agree that the decision or award of the arbitrator shall be final and binding on each of the parties and that they will abide thereby, unless the award is vacated pursuant to statute. The power of the arbitrator in this process shall be limited to determine whether the policy, procedure, or rule is unreasonable.",
            "block_bbox": [
                105,
                764,
                1117,
                864
            ],
            "block_id": 8,
            "block_order": 9,
            "group_id": 8,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    104.36209869384766,
